              <a class="fx-btn fx-btn-ghost" href="#fx-avisos"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="fx-i" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 5 2 6 2 6H4s2-1 2-6M9.5 20a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 5 0"/></svg>Activar avisos</a>
